                    {
                        "sense_id": "b4505f66-aa57-302f-9ad4-dd49ef794a56",
                        "entry_id": "06f9778a-d2a0-348c-923e-29153172c016",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The ability to detect whether or not a person is bisexual by observing that person."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "951bd43e-63f6-4144-a849-9f35de0bc4af",
                                "sense_id": "b4505f66-aa57-302f-9ad4-dd49ef794a56",
                                "text": "Though I _think_ he's straight: but then my bidar isn't always running at 100%."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a46d4117-26e4-4bdf-92bd-58bbb3ac3219",
                                "sense_id": "b4505f66-aa57-302f-9ad4-dd49ef794a56",
                                "text": "Bi people hang in straight places a lot, and given that you are also bi, they will probably stand out to you in an indescribable, nonverbal way. And that, my friend, is bidar."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0c0c20e-ae20-401b-bcfc-5d649cee4fdb",
                                "sense_id": "b4505f66-aa57-302f-9ad4-dd49ef794a56",
                                "text": "Of course, not all bisexuals are recognizable, and many will easily defy the bidar, whereas others will appear to be bisexuals without actually identifying as bi."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
